<%# Inline add-contact validation failure (proposal wizard opening step).
    Replace only the modal's inner Turbo Frame so the dialog stays open and shows
    the field errors. We echo back the submitted estimate_id verbatim (nil if it
    was bad/forged) rather than reconstructing an Estimate — so a valid id
    round-trips intact and the corrected resubmit can rebuild the wizard field,
    and a bad id never resurfaces as a dummy record with a nil id. %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "add_contact_modal_frame" do %>
  <%= render "proposals/steps/add_contact_modal_frame",
      client: @client, estimate_id: params[:estimate_id], contact: @contact %>
<% end %>
